                                "text": "Farm life is beautiful, my friends, when well and rightly lived. And the very word Farmwife has grown sweeter with the years. Long ago I resented the imputation implied. Today, I say \"yes\" to the charge, and add that \"of the distinction I'm proud.\" Are not you?"
